#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:267
msgid ""
"For the UR10e deployment, we use an impedance controller interface. Using"
" a simpler controller like impedance control reduces the chances of "
"variation between simulation and reality compared to more complex "
"controllers (e.g., operational space control, hybrid force-position "
"control). Simpler controllers:"
msgstr ""
