#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:468
msgid "This command will:"
msgstr "此命令将:"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:470
msgid "Run 256 parallel environments for efficient training"
msgstr "运行 256 个并行环境以进行高效训练"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:471
msgid "Run in headless mode (no visualization) for maximum performance"
msgstr "在无头模式下运行（无可视化）以获得最佳性能"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:472
msgid "Record videos every 5000 steps to monitor training progress"
msgstr "每 5000 步录制视频以监控训练进度"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:473
msgid "Save videos with 800 frames each"
msgstr "每个视频保存 800 帧"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:475
msgid ""
"Training typically takes ~12-24 hours for a robust insertion policy. The "
"videos will be saved in the ``logs`` directory and can be reviewed to "
"assess policy performance during training."
msgstr ""
"训练一个稳健的插入策略通常需要约 12-24 小时。视频将保存在 ``logs`` 目录中，可以查看以评估训练期间的策略性能。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:479
msgid ""
"**GPU Memory Considerations**: The default configuration uses 256 "
"parallel environments, which should work on most modern GPUs (e.g., RTX "
"3090, RTX 4090, A100). For better sim-to-real transfer performance, you "
"can increase ``solver_position_iteration_count`` from 4 to 196 in "
"``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` and ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` for more "
"realistic contact simulation, but this requires a larger GPU (e.g., RTX "
"PRO 6000 with 40GB+ VRAM). Higher solver iteration counts reduce "
"penetration and improve contact stability but significantly increase GPU "
"memory usage."
msgstr ""
"**GPU 内存注意事项**: 默认配置使用 256 个并行环境，这应该适用于大多数现代 GPU（例如 RTX 3090、RTX 4090、A100）。"
"为了获得更好的仿真到真实迁移性能，您可以在 ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` 和 ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` 中"
"将 ``solver_position_iteration_count`` 从 4 增加到 196 以获得更真实的接触仿真，但这需要更大的 GPU"
"（例如具有 40GB+ VRAM 的 RTX PRO 6000）。更高的求解器迭代次数可以减少穿透并提高接触稳定性，但会显著增加 GPU 内存使用量。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:482
msgid "**Monitoring Training Progress with TensorBoard:**"
msgstr "**使用 TensorBoard 监控训练进度:**"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:484
msgid ""
"You can monitor training metrics in real-time using TensorBoard. Open a "
"new terminal and run:"
msgstr "您可以使用 TensorBoard 实时监控训练指标。打开一个新终端并运行: "

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:490
msgid ""
"Replace ``<log_dir>`` with the path to your training logs (e.g., "
"``logs/rsl_rl/gear_assembly_ur10e/2025-11-19_19-31-01``). TensorBoard "
"will display plots showing rewards, episode lengths, and other metrics. "
"Verify that the rewards are increasing over iterations to ensure the "
"policy is learning successfully."
msgstr ""
"将 ``<log_dir>`` 替换为您的训练日志路径（例如 ``logs/rsl_rl/gear_assembly_ur10e/2025-11-19_19-31-01`` ）。"
"TensorBoard 将显示奖励、回合长度和其他指标的图表。验证奖励在迭代过程中是否增加，以确保策略正在成功学习。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:494
msgid "Step 3: Deploy on Real Robot"
msgstr "步骤 3: 部署到真实机器人"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:496
msgid ""
"Once training is complete, follow the `Isaac ROS inference documentation "
"<https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/packages/isaac_manipulator_ur_dnn_policy/index.html>`_"
" to deploy your policy."
msgstr ""
"训练完成后，按照 `Isaac ROS 推理文档 <https://nvidia-isaac-ros.github.io/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/packages/isaac_manipulator_ur_dnn_policy/index.html>`_ 部署您的策略。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:498
msgid ""
"The Isaac ROS deployment pipeline directly uses the trained model "
"checkpoint (``.pt`` file) along with the ``agent.yaml`` and ``env.yaml`` "
"configuration files generated during training. No additional export step "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"Isaac ROS 部署管线直接使用训练好的模型检查点（ ``.pt`` 文件）以及训练期间生成的 ``agent.yaml`` 和 ``env.yaml`` 配置文件。无需额外的导出步骤。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:500
msgid ""
"The deployment pipeline uses Isaac ROS and a custom ROS inference node to"
" run the policy on real hardware. The pipeline includes:"
msgstr "部署管线使用 Isaac ROS 和自定义 ROS 推理节点在真实硬件上运行策略。管线包括: "

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:502
msgid ""
"**Perception**: Camera-based pose estimation (FoundationPose, Segment "
"Anything)"
msgstr "**感知**: 基于相机的位姿估计（FoundationPose、Segment Anything）"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:503
