msgstr "**策略推理**: 您训练好的策略在自定义 ROS 推理节点中以控制频率运行"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:505
msgid "**Robot Control**: Low-level controller executing commands"
msgstr "**机器人控制**: 执行命令的底层控制器"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:509
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:511
msgid ""
"This section covers common errors you may encounter during training and "
"their solutions."
msgstr "本节介绍您在训练期间可能遇到的常见错误及其解决方案。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:514
msgid "PhysX Collision Stack Overflow"
msgstr "PhysX 碰撞堆栈溢出"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:516
#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:544
msgid "**Error Message:**"
msgstr "**错误消息:**"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:524
msgid ""
"**Cause:** This error occurs when the GPU collision detection buffer is "
"too small for the number of contacts being simulated. This is common in "
"contact-rich environments like gear assembly."
msgstr ""
"**原因:** 当 GPU 碰撞检测缓冲区对于正在仿真的接触数量来说太小时，会发生此错误。这在齿轮装配等接触密集型环境中很常见。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:526
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Increase the ``gpu_collision_stack_size`` parameter in "
"``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py``:"
msgstr "**解决方案:** 在 ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` 中增加 ``gpu_collision_stack_size`` 参数: "

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:539
msgid ""
"The error message will suggest a minimum size. Set "
"``gpu_collision_stack_size`` to at least the recommended value (e.g., if "
"the error says \"at least 269452544\", set it to ``2**28`` or ``2**29``)."
" Note that increasing this value increases GPU memory usage."
msgstr ""
"错误消息会建议最小大小。将 ``gpu_collision_stack_size`` 设置为至少推荐的值（例如，如果错误提示 \"至少 269452544\" ，"
"则将其设置为 ``2**28`` 或 ``2**29`` ）。请注意，增加此值会增加 GPU 内存使用量。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:542
msgid "CUDA Out of Memory"
msgstr "CUDA 内存不足"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:550
msgid ""
"**Cause:** The GPU does not have enough memory to run the requested "
"number of parallel environments with the current simulation parameters."
msgstr "**原因: ** GPU 没有足够的内存来使用当前仿真参数运行请求的并行环境数量。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:552
msgid "**Solutions (in order of preference):**"
msgstr "**解决方案（按优先顺序）:**"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:554
msgid "**Reduce the number of parallel environments:**"
msgstr "**减少并行环境数量:**"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:563
msgid ""
"**Trade-off:** Using fewer environments will reduce sample diversity per "
"training iteration and may slow down training convergence. You may need "
"to train for more iterations to achieve the same performance. However, "
"the final policy quality should be similar."
msgstr ""
"**权衡:** 使用更少的环境会减少每次训练迭代的样本多样性，可能会减慢训练收敛速度。您可能需要训练更多迭代才能达到相同的性能。"
"但是，最终的策略质量应该相似。"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:565
msgid ""
"**If using increased solver iteration counts** (values higher than the "
"default 4):"
msgstr "**如果使用增加的求解器迭代次数**（高于默认值 4 的值）:"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:567
msgid ""
"In both ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` and ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py``, reduce"
" ``solver_position_iteration_count`` back to the default value of 4, or "
"use intermediate values like 8 or 16:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``gear_assembly_env_cfg.py`` 和 ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` 中，将 ``solver_position_iteration_count`` "
"减少回默认值 4，或使用中间值如 8 或 16:"

#: ../../source/policy_deployment/02_gear_assembly/gear_assembly_policy.rst:581
msgid ""
"**Trade-off:** Lower solver iteration counts may result in less realistic"
" contact dynamics and more penetration issues. The default value of 4 "
"provides a good balance for most use cases."
msgstr ""
"**权衡:** 较低的求解器迭代次数可能导致接触动力学不太真实且穿透问题更多。默认值 4 为大多数用例提供了良好的平衡。"

